","kind":"announcement","title":"NextFest Livestream","summary":"Hi Terraformers,Project Tomorrow is part of the October Steam Next Fest, and I'll be streaming some gameplay to celebrate!Feel free to critique my strategy because after seeing some crazy high scores, I know some of you are waaaaaaaay better than me at my own game.A massive thank you to everyone who's played the demo and provided feedback to make the game better than I could imagine. And my sincere gratitude to the over 30,000 of you who have wishlisted the game. This is best possible way to hel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:12:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688773","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1845383656397639","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"Project Tomorrow will release into Early Access on November 9, 2026","summary":"Hi Terraformers!I very excited to announce that Project Tomorrow will release into Early Access of November 9, 2026.Why Early Access?If releasing the demo taught me anything, it’s just how much player feedback has improved the game already. Your feedback and ideas have already helped shape Project Tomorrow and I’m looking forward to continuing that process throughout Early Access.But, make no mistake, the Early Access release will be a polished experience with three fully playable regions, 20 bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T21:34:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397639","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1844751498225969","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"Full Map, More Freedom & Better Performance","summary":"Hey Terraformers!I just released Project Tomorrow v0.2.6! This update focuses on your feedback, which has been sooooo helpful in improving the game. Keep it coming, and thank you for helping make Project Tomorrow better with every update!Here's what's new.Full MapThe minimap is great for keeping track of your immediate surroundings, but sometimes you need to see the bigger picture. Especially when enemy hordes are attacking from mutiple directions.You can now open the full map to see every build","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T21:29:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1844115010487991","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"The next region is here!","summary":"Hi Terraformers,I'm pumped to announce that a new region, Tidehaven, is here!Tidehaven is a barren volcanic wasteland and it's up to you to transform it back into the tropical oasis it once was.This region introduces some new mechanics and I'd love to hear what you think of them.First up is automation. You'll unlock a new building called the Resource Hub, which gives you additional storage and houses collection drones that automatically gather resources for you. That means more time building and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T03:07:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487991","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1842846814438917","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"Getting Out of the Player’s Way","summary":"\"Busy Trash\"It’s not the feedback I wanted to hear, but it was feedback I needed to hear.Players were spending too much time managing inventory and navigating menus — and not enough time actually playing the game.So the latest update takes a big swing at fixing that.Your backpack now has 50% more storage at every upgrade level, and I’ve moved a feature I was originally saving for Region 2 into the first region. And you can craft it early...The Resource Uplink lets you build and craft using resou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T00:42:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814438917","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1841579228670455","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"Fixing what was broken","summary":"“It’s boring.”That’s the constructive criticism I heard most after the demo launched on Monday.And you know what? You were right.Every action you took brought the next enemy wave close but terraforming increased every second. That meant one of the strongest strategies was also the least interesting one:Sit around and do nothing.So I changed it.Terraforming has been completely reworkedTerraforming no longer increases over time.Now you earn Terraform by:Building Terraforming structuresUpgrading th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T00:22:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670455","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1840944183787016","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"You Can Finally Play Project Tomorrow","summary":"I’ve been working on this game whenever I can for over a year, and today is a pretty big milestone for me: you can finally play it.The demo takes you through the first region of the game and introduces the core systems: building, terraforming, exploration, and combat. There’s a lot more still to come, including food, water, and automated mining systems that are introduced in the second region.I'd be super pumped if you gave it a try and I hope you love it but I'd love to hear your opinion no mat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T18:54:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787016","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1833334318578107","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed Playtest Begins","summary":"Hi Terraformers!I’m excited to announce that Project Tomorrow is now being actively played in a closed playtest.The current group of testers is still fairly small, and now that the initial wave of bugs is behind us, I’d love to invite more players to join. If you’re interested in helping shape the game early, there’s a link to apply at the bottom of this post.Now for the update!Over the last few weeks, I’ve redesigned how players complete a region and progress to the next area of Earth.Previousl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-25T21:41:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318578107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1827626365748845","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"🌍 Selected for Earth Appreciation Festival + 9,000 Wishlists!","summary":"We just crossed 9,000 wishlists—thank you. That kind of support is more than I could ever ask for.On top of that, Project Tomorrow has been selected for the upcoming Earth Appreciation Festival on Steam. I'm very proud of these accomplishments 🤩On the development side, I’m focused on building a large, explorable world. I’ve just completed a procedural terrain system, which allows me to create and iterate on environments much faster. I’m now actively working toward a playable demo, with a closed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-17T22:53:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365748845","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402200-1825727806709018","game_id":"steam-4402200","kind":"announcement","title":"Project Tomorrow Is Live on Steam + First Devlog","summary":"Hi everyone!Thank you for the incredible support for Project Tomorrow. It’s been a dizzying 48 hours since the Steam page went live, and I’m soooo grateful for the momentum and wishlists.If you're interested in the nerdy behind the scenes stuff — from procedural systems to performance optimizations — I just released the first behind-the-scenes devlog on YouTube. It dives into the story, tech, and design philosophy driving the project.You can watch it here:And if you haven’t yet, wishlisting the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-26T21:32:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806709018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4402200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4402200":"2026-10-26T12:10:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4402200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:31Z"},"4597810":{"last